00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00
# option 1, source link-layer address 00:00:5e:00:53:03
01 01 00 00 5e 00 53 03
# option 3, prefix information, 4 units: prefix length 64, flags 0xc0 (L, A)
03 04 40 c0
# valid lifetime 86400 s, preferred lifetime 14400 s, reserved
00 01 51 80
00 00 38 40
00 00 00 00
# prefix 2001:db8:100::
20 01 0d b8 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
